+    hidden offset), server only encodes (skip_generation) -> target video for training; tf = the policy acts with the
+    replanned oracle video (tf_replan) from there (D3). Failed attempts: k in snap_ks (default 1,2,3); successful
+    attempts: k = 2 only (irrelevant-context pairs). Summary in <attempt dir>/snap_info.json."""
