+    closed (same reset rule as the training data); the retry starts there with the variant's adapter (video pass
+    only), its context of the failed attempt (or a FOREIGN failure with the opposite sign of the hidden parameter) and
+    the own past up to the reset point in the KV cache. Base successes get the same retry with their own (successful)
+    attempt as context: does the adapter harm where nothing had to be corrected?"""
